  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Irish potato production through the improvement of farmers&apos; access to quality Irish potato seeds in Rulindo district</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the action is to To promote food and nutrition security as well as food systems resilience in Rwanda. This &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;will be achieved through two outcomes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Outcome 1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Increased sustainable food production of Irish potato producers &lt;/span&gt;in the Rulindo District.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 2&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Improved incomes and access to the market for &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Irish potato producers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The following outputs will contribute to the achievement of the above outcome and objective;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1&lt;/strong&gt;: Increased sustainable supply of safe and quality of Irish potato seeds to smallholder farmers and farmer cooperatives/groups,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Sustainable agricultural practices are promoted,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Output 3&lt;/strong&gt;: The Irish potato value chain and market linkages are enhanced.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
